cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this artifact, please cite the paper "Cardinality Estimation with
  Star Degree Summaries" (under submission).
title: "StarCE: Cardinality Estimation with Star Degree Summaries"
abstract: >-
  StarCE is a cardinality estimator built on star degree summaries (StarDS),
  implemented inside DuckDB. This repository contains the full system, the
  baselines, all query workloads with true cardinalities and baseline
  estimates, and scripts that reproduce every experiment in the paper.
license: Apache-2.0
